	f	[D	COSINE_OF_ARCSINE_TABLE	u	field_15722
		c	Holds values of cos(arcsin(x)): {@code COSINE_OF_ARCSINE_TABLE[i]} is equal to\n{@code Math.cos(Math.arcsin(i / 256.0))}.\n\n<p>This is used by {@link MathHelper#atan2} to approximate the inverse\ntangent function.
